{"id":"f2b15fc22e8e3f0c","group":"29","path":"29/29-thm-bounded-variable-zero-one.md","title":"任意 k 变量句子集的零一律","display":"thm-bounded-variable-zero-one — 任意 k 变量句子集的零一律","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)","book_abbrev":"29","label":"29-thm-bounded-variable-zero-one","aliases":["29-thm-bounded-variable-zero-one"],"display":"thm-bounded-variable-zero-one — 任意 k 变量句子集的零一律","depends_on":["[[29-df-lk]]","[[29-df-asymptotic-prob]]","[[29-df-extension-axioms]]","[[29-lem-extension-probability]]","[[29-lem-extension-pebble]]"],"source_locator":"Theorem 6.40, pp.108–109, DjVu scans 123–124","source_basis":"用户提供的 DjVu 正文；独立抽取及来源核对见本轮维护报告","revision_basis":"本次仅据用户提供的29(1).zip修订；既有原书定位及过往核对叙述为继承记录，未重新取得或查看DjVu原件","revision_verification":"数学类型与接口审查、静态结构及链接检查；未提交证明助理内核证书"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"29"},{"key":"label","html":"29-thm-bounded-variable-zero-one"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>29-thm-bounded-variable-zero-one</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-bounded-variable-zero-one — 任意 k 变量句子集的零一律"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"4de7fc2c34b9d839\" href=\"?note=4de7fc2c34b9d839\" title=\"29-df-lk\">29-df-lk</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"7e0b02880da0dad2\" href=\"?note=7e0b02880da0dad2\" title=\"29-df-asymptotic-prob\">29-df-asymptotic-prob</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"8bcb53a9a5bd9405\" href=\"?note=8bcb53a9a5bd9405\" title=\"29-df-extension-axioms\">29-df-extension-axioms</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"cbf2193c8d68c9be\" href=\"?note=cbf2193c8d68c9be\" title=\"29-lem-extension-probability\">29-lem-extension-probability</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"083aeefac65087f4\" href=\"?note=083aeefac65087f4\" title=\"29-lem-extension-pebble\">29-lem-extension-pebble</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_locator","html":"Theorem 6.40, pp.108–109, DjVu scans 123–124"},{"key":"source_basis","html":"用户提供的 DjVu 正文；独立抽取及来源核对见本轮维护报告"},{"key":"revision_basis","html":"本次仅据用户提供的29(1).zip修订；既有原书定位及过往核对叙述为继承记录，未重新取得或查看DjVu原件"},{"key":"revision_verification","html":"数学类型与接口审查、静态结构及链接检查；未提交证明助理内核证书"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\">\\(\\tau\\)</span> 为有限纯关系词汇，所有关系元数为正；无函数、常量和内建数值谓词。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\geq1\">\\(k\\geq1\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\\subseteq L^k_\\tau\\cap\\mathrm{Sent}_\\tau\">\\(S\\subseteq L^k_\\tau\\cap\\mathrm{Sent}_\\tau\\)</span> 可以是无限的句子集合；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ModTh}_\\tau(S)\">\\(\\operatorname{ModTh}_\\tau(S)\\)</span> 及 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mu^{\\mathrm{Th}}_{\\tau,n}(S)\">\\(\\mu^{\\mathrm{Th}}_{\\tau,n}(S)\\)</span> 在下式定义。这里同时满足所有句子是元语言条件，不是新增的无限合取 FO 公式。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ModTh}_\\tau(S)\\coloneqq\\{A\\in\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\tau]\\mid\\forall\\varphi\\in S\\;A\\models\\varphi\\},\\qquad\\mu^{\\mathrm{Th}}_{\\tau,n}(S)\\coloneqq\\mu_{\\tau,n}(\\operatorname{ModTh}_\\tau(S)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{ModTh}_\\tau(S)\\coloneqq\\{A\\in\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\tau]\\mid\\forall\\varphi\\in S\\;A\\models\\varphi\\},\\qquad\\mu^{\\mathrm{Th}}_{\\tau,n}(S)\\coloneqq\\mu_{\\tau,n}(\\operatorname{ModTh}_\\tau(S)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\exists p\\in\\{0,1\\}\\;\\lim_{n\\to\\infty}\\mu^{\\mathrm{Th}}_{\\tau,n}(S)=p.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\exists p\\in\\{0,1\\}\\;\\lim_{n\\to\\infty}\\mu^{\\mathrm{Th}}_{\\tau,n}(S)=p.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 Theorem 6.40，印刷页 108–109，扫描页 123–124。扩张公理的模型几乎必然存在，且所有这样的模型满足相同 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\">\\(k\\)</span> 变量句子。选一个扩张模型 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_0\">\\(A_0\\)</span>：若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_0\">\\(A_0\\)</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> 中每个句子，则所有扩张模型都满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span>，概率趋于一；否则选一个失败句子，所有扩张模型均不满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span>，概率趋于零。该证明涵盖无限 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span>，不使用错误的无限并集概率交换。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S=\\varnothing\">\\(S=\\varnothing\\)</span> 时概率恒为一。已核对原书陈述、证明及依赖两条引理。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"29-df-lk","status":"resolved","id":"4de7fc2c34b9d839","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-lk]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-asymptotic-prob","status":"resolved","id":"7e0b02880da0dad2","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-asymptotic-prob]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-extension-axioms","status":"resolved","id":"8bcb53a9a5bd9405","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-extension-axioms]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-lem-extension-probability","status":"resolved","id":"cbf2193c8d68c9be","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-lem-extension-probability]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-lem-extension-pebble","status":"resolved","id":"083aeefac65087f4","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-lem-extension-pebble]]","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\tau","display":false},{"tex":"k\\geq1","display":false},{"tex":"S\\subseteq L^k_\\tau\\cap\\mathrm{Sent}_\\tau","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ModTh}_\\tau(S)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mu^{\\mathrm{Th}}_{\\tau,n}(S)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ModTh}_\\tau(S)\\coloneqq\\{A\\in\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\tau]\\mid\\forall\\varphi\\in S\\;A\\models\\varphi\\},\\qquad\\mu^{\\mathrm{Th}}_{\\tau,n}(S)\\coloneqq\\mu_{\\tau,n}(\\operatorname{ModTh}_\\tau(S)).","display":true},{"tex":"\\exists p\\in\\{0,1\\}\\;\\lim_{n\\to\\infty}\\mu^{\\mathrm{Th}}_{\\tau,n}(S)=p.","display":true},{"tex":"k","display":false},{"tex":"A_0","display":false},{"tex":"A_0","display":false},{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"S=\\varnothing","display":false}],"bytes":2161,"backlinks":[{"id":"38909ffa6d1e85ce","anchor":"ref-104","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[29-thm-bounded-variable-zero-one]]、[[29-ex-zero-one-constant]] — 句子集零一律及加入常量的反例"},{"id":"fb492e1d42d41f7a","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"原书 Theorem 6.40 与 Corollary 6.41，印刷页 108–109、扫描页 123–124；概率与扩张公理见 pp.107–108、扫描页 122–123。已核对陈述与所给证明：每个 FO 句子仅含有限多个变量，故应用 [[29-thm-bounded-variable-zero-one]] 到其单元素句子集。原先仅以“关系词汇”排除函数，却仍允许常量；在 $\\tau=\\langle P^{(1)},c\\rangle$ 上 $\\mu_{\\tau,n}(P(c))=1/2$，因此常量排除不可省略。本条同时断言极限存在，未把收敛预先作为假设。"},{"id":"ecc0dd131d213345","anchor":"ref-171","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../29-thm-bounded-variable-zero-one]]"},{"id":"bfe1be5f707cc63a","anchor":"ref-20","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../29-thm-bounded-variable-zero-one|29-thm-bounded-variable-zero-one]]"}],"outgoing":["4de7fc2c34b9d839","7e0b02880da0dad2","8bcb53a9a5bd9405","cbf2193c8d68c9be","083aeefac65087f4"]}